        "content": "## Free web search (no API key)\nSearches the web with AgentSearch and returns up to 5 cited results (title, URL, snippet). 25 free searches/day per user.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Manual Trigger** starts the run (swap for Chat, Schedule or Webhook).\n2. **Set Query** holds the question.\n3. **AgentSearch (free)** calls the free search endpoint, no credentials.\n4. **One Item per Result** splits results into items.\n\n### Setup\nEdit the query in **Set Query**, then run.\n\n### Customize\nConnect results to an AI Agent or LLM node to answer with citations. Self-hosted: install the community node `n8n-nodes-agentsearch`.",
